      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear what u say about the wires and stuff but it's just so specific. like, it doesn't happen when im calm. it's always right when my heart starts racing or i feel that surge of heat when i'm frustrated. it feels way too connected to be a coincidence. if it is some kind of electromagnetic thing tied to my emotions... how do i actually control it? i don't want to keep breaking stuff or making people uncomfortable at the office.",
